    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by SkiFree, <i>Yeti Ski</i> takes you back to the mountain for an authentic retro experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy all the original game modes, dodging obstacles and other skiers while catching air and pulling radical stunts. <br>Carve up powder as you zig-zag down the slalom course, or just chill out in freestyle mode. <br>Earn achievements and compete against other skiers to get the top position on the leaderboards.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the classic SkiFree experience in the age of high-definition, with an eye-friendly color palette and atmospheric beats to complete the vibe. <br> Enjoy gamepad support and an intuitive control experience, playing on keyboard or gamepad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But whatever you do, watch out for the Yeti! <br>It's back, and as mean as ever. <br>Will you escape the abominable monster, or meet your doom on the mountain?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's ski!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by SkiFree, <i>Yeti Ski</i> takes you back to the mountain for an authentic retro experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy all the original game modes, dodging obstacles and other skiers while catching air and pulling radical stunts. <br>Carve up powder as you zig-zag down the slalom course, or just chill out in freestyle mode. <br>Earn achievements and compete against other skiers to get the top position on the leaderboards.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the classic SkiFree experience in the age of high-definition, with an eye-friendly color palette and atmospheric beats to complete the vibe. <br> Enjoy gamepad support and an intuitive control experience, playing on keyboard or gamepad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But whatever you do, watch out for the Yeti! <br>It's back, and as mean as ever. <br>Will you escape the abominable monster, or meet your doom on the mountain?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's ski!</p>",
